  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A better future for 50 youth from Tucuman</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lack of financial education is a contributing factor in hindering people&apos;s prosperity. The basic elements of finance such as saving, investing, budgeting and credit seem totally inaccessible to vulnerable populations. This project perceives financial education as a resource that can be available to everyone and that provides tools to improve quality of life and the possibility of developing behaviors that allow people to have a healthy relationship with money and improve personal well-being.</narrative>
  </description>
